  "details": "Hello hello !\n\nI would like to be able to blacklist, if possible, certains world to appear in the friend locations category.\n\nI'll be honest, most of my friendlist is currently desktop afk in idle home and it's actively making my friend locations page look not so great, I also have specific worlds I do not wish to see / go anymore so that'd be nice aswell\n\nI don't want to remove my friends, they can enjoy funny idle games in VRC if they want, but I'd like control over what worlds show up in here.\n\nThat's about all I had to drop here.",
